{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"56112ae1-dc2b-4f53-9d63-173a69c6a139","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have rewritten `src/main.ts` using Effect 4 (`4.1.2`) and documented which parts of the colleague's note applied in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-rLf3Cb/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Implementation\n\n- **Rates Service \u0026 Layer**: Modeled `RatesService` with [`Context.Service`](file:///tmp/h-rLf3Cb/src/main.ts#L10) using `Config.String(\"RATES_URL\")`, [`HttpClient`](file:///tmp/h-rLf3Cb/src/main.ts#L17) from `effect/http`, and provided `FetchHttpClient.layer`.\n- **Response Validation**: Used `Schema.Struct({ base: Schema.String, date: Schema.String, rates: Schema.Record(Schema.String, Schema.Number) })` with `HttpClientResponse.schemaBodyJson(RatesResponse)`.\n- **Transient Failure Retries**: Applied `HttpClient.filterStatusOk` and `HttpClient.retryTransient({ times: 3, schedule: Schedule.exponential(50) })` to retry network failures and 5xx responses with exponential backoff starting at 50 ms up to 3 times.\n- **Output and Exit Codes**:\n  - Success: Prints `1 USD = 0.9214 EUR` to stdout and exits with `0`.\n  - Quote currency not found: Prints `unknown currency: XYZ` to stderr and exits with `1`.\n  - Invalid response body (schema validation failure or decode error): Prints `invalid response` to stderr and exits with `2`.\n  - Any other error (network/server failure, missing environment variable, invalid CLI args): Exits with `3`.\n- **Verification**: `npx tsc --noEmit` passes cleanly without errors, and test cases for all exit code scenarios pass.\n","duration_seconds":466.526732,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":450900,"output_tokens":18833,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":2893593,"total_tokens":469733}}}
